+<h1>Ice Compact on its pedestal</h1><p>Actual Godot 4.7.2 captures from the shipping prop builder, editor and Winter race. Original native PNGs, without image edits. Both renderer choices below ran on a desktop RTX 3090; Android remains untested.</p>
