+<img id="capture" src="gl_compatibility/studio.png" alt="Native Ice Compact sculpture capture"><p>Winter → Props → Ice Compact. Stock Compact profiles, carved ice fittings and seated wheels; stepped snow-covered pedestal. Placement, undo/redo, local JSON reload and the new asset's native checks pass in both desktop renderers. The broader older castle Mobile suite retains strict delta1 igloo pixel failures, including unchanged original controls; see the report.</p>
